    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK THIS OUT</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1723720348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/d3143429ca01bce79673f7d61bc4d803.poster.avif?t=1723720348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/d3143429ca01bce79673f7d61bc4d803.webm?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>STRATEGY MODE</strong><br>WWBS is a strategy game where you can assume first-person control over any unit fighting on the field of battle. Apply the right strategy to different maps and directly support your troops on the frontlines! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/2ba1ceb5f1ed68b74ca6f44bcf1af1c8.poster.avif?t=1723720348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/2ba1ceb5f1ed68b74ca6f44bcf1af1c8.webm?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/2ba1ceb5f1ed68b74ca6f44bcf1af1c8.mp4?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>FIRST-PERSON MODE</strong><br>Support your army in direct combat on the frontlines. Play as any of the units and, for example, take control of heavy machine guns, trucks, planes, tanks, and many other weapons of war\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/dfeaa6b76035e83cc3b76777e3a84d69.poster.avif?t=1723720348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/dfeaa6b76035e83cc3b76777e3a84d69.webm?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/dfeaa6b76035e83cc3b76777e3a84d69.mp4?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>VIEW MODE</strong><br>Support your army in direct combat on the frontlines. Play as any of the units and, for example, take control of heavy machine guns, trucks, planes, tanks, and many other weapons of war\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/2e3670b06bf7f5e05128afd4b25c9883.poster.avif?t=1723720348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/2e3670b06bf7f5e05128afd4b25c9883.webm?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/2e3670b06bf7f5e05128afd4b25c9883.mp4?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>QUICK UNIT SWITCH</strong><br>When playing in first person, you can quickly switch between particular units. This makes it possible for you to quickly help out your soldiers at various locations on the battlefield.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/48f4d0856700a4b035b45ffaf9acadb7.poster.avif?t=1723720348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/48f4d0856700a4b035b45ffaf9acadb7.webm?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/48f4d0856700a4b035b45ffaf9acadb7.mp4?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>A VARIETY OF UNITS</strong><br>Soldiers, medics, grenadiers, generals, HMGs, anti-aircraft guns, trucks, tanks, and planes are only some of the available forces. As you progress through the game, you get to unlock more units that bring more to the battle plan table.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/9fe6a97a3833639d3d7eaf9bd56efe14.poster.avif?t=1723720348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/9fe6a97a3833639d3d7eaf9bd56efe14.webm?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/9fe6a97a3833639d3d7eaf9bd56efe14.mp4?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>EXTENSIVE MAPS</strong><br>All maps have been designed so as to fully utilize the potential of each unit. Set up your guns on hills to make them inaccessible to enemy infantry, place obstacles, or guide the fight into natural barriers such as forests or crags.<br><br>It\u2019s up to you who wins this conflict!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1723720348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/d3143429ca01bce79673f7d61bc4d803.poster.avif?t=1723720348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/d3143429ca01bce79673f7d61bc4d803.webm?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>STRATEGY MODE</strong><br>WWBS is a strategy game where you can assume first-person control over any unit fighting on the field of battle. Apply the right strategy to different maps and directly support your troops on the frontlines! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/2ba1ceb5f1ed68b74ca6f44bcf1af1c8.poster.avif?t=1723720348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/2ba1ceb5f1ed68b74ca6f44bcf1af1c8.webm?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472570/extras/2ba1ceb5f1ed68b74ca6f44bcf1af1c8.mp4?t=1723720348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>FIRST-PERSON MODE</strong><br>Support your army in d